{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19105300","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19105300","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1910530001:1":{"text":"カーリュさん、様子を見に来たんだけど……","source_cn":"卡律先生，我们来看你了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x844619B48D45930F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910530002:1":{"text":"あまり近づくな。用があるならそこで言え。","source_cn":"别靠近，有事就这样说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00EC12266757EC8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910530003:1":{"text":"カーリュさんは、あたしたちを傷つけるつもりなんてないんでしょ！だったら、隠れる必要なんてないのに……","source_cn":"我知道你其实不想伤害我们！你完全没必要躲着我们呀……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F085CF1FD8C2F62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910530004:1":{"text":"我知道自己在做什么，浅海裔的女儿。如果不想你和你的族裔被撕碎，就出去。","source_cn":"我知道自己在做什么，浅海裔的女儿。如果不想你和你的族裔...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x85A0D2B12F3DA1E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910530005:1":{"text":"質問があるなら他の二人に喋らせろ。あいつらなら殺意も湧かない。","source_cn":"有话让那两个人问，我不会对他们产生杀意。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x99AA43B2CAFFBF7A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"質問があるなら他の二人に喋らせろ。あいつらなら殺意も湧かない。","female":"質問があるなら他の二人に喋らせろ。あいつらなら殺意も湧かない。","variant_male_record_index":"252690","variant_female_record_index":"252691","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910530006:1":{"text":"お前は出ていけ。","source_cn":"出去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE38CFF5724113D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:9:1910530007:1":{"text":"エフィラはあなたたちをちらりと見て、しょんぼりとしながら出ていった。","source_cn":"","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9AD81307F6FEFFCB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"エフィラはあなたたちをちらりと見て、しょんぼりとしながら出ていった。","female":"エフィラはあなたたちをちらりと見て、しょんぼりとしながら出ていった。","variant_male_record_index":"252693","variant_female_record_index":"252694","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1910530008:1":{"text":"具合はもういいのか？","source_cn":"你身体恢复了？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3F51C485F453FCEA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"具合はもういいのか？","female":"具合はもういいのか？","variant_male_record_index":"252695","variant_female_record_index":"252696","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1910530008":{"text":"具合はもういいのか？","source_cn":"你身体恢复了？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3F51C485F453FCEA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"具合はもういいのか？","female":"具合はもういいのか？","variant_male_record_index":"252695","variant_female_record_index":"252696","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1910530009:1":{"text":"我看到你做了什么，你的天赋……很了不起。","source_cn":"我看到你做了什么，你的天赋……很了不起。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xB9B9CD3DBA9189A5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"252697","variant_female_record_index":"252698","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1910530012:1":{"text":"触手男、あの水みたいな光はどこから来たんだ？","source_cn":"触手男，那些海水一样的光是哪儿来的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2A7D516E5A0B58A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1910530013:1":{"text":"深海だ。下から上へ湧き上がっている。ほかのハダルたち――タラサを襲った者は皆、あの中で光の粒と泡になった。","source_cn":"深海，自下而上涌来。其他深海裔……那些袭击塔拉萨的族裔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC7CA196C220D07C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1910530013":{"text":"深海だ。下から上へ湧き上がっている。ほかのハダルたち――タラサを襲った者は皆、あの中で光の粒と泡になった。","source_cn":"深海，自下而上涌来。其他深海裔……那些袭击塔拉萨的族裔，都在潮光里化成了光点和泡沫。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC7CA196C220D07C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1910530014:1":{"text":"ハダル、俺たちの家、異端者、正気を失った者たち……\n異端者……","source_cn":"深海族裔，我们的家，狂人、疯子，还能有什么？\\n狂人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4571D236E790C57A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:17:0:1":{"text":"深海には何があるんだ？","source_cn":"深海里有什么？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x733DEBD5290493EB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"深海には何があるんだ？","female":"深海には何があるの？","variant_male_record_index":"95808","variant_female_record_index":"95809","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1910530015:1":{"text":"あった。正しくは、一人いた……","source_cn":"……有。有一个人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x414000B5D5A9B9B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:17:1:2":{"text":"光が現れる前、何か異常はなかったか？","source_cn":"潮光来袭之前，有没有异常？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9919897246E4AA12","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"光が現れる前、何か異常はなかったか？","female":"光が現れる前、何か異常はなかった？","variant_male_record_index":"95810","variant_female_record_index":"95811","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1910530016:1":{"text":"リトラの娘を呼べ。確認したいことがある。だが、俺には近づかせるな……","source_cn":"叫那个浅海裔的女儿进来，要找她确认，但别让她靠近……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF2637DAD43F0402","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1910530017:1":{"text":"はいはーい！扉の外で話を聞いてたの。確認したいことってなに？","source_cn":"——我在！我一直在门外偷听呢，需要我做什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3872A93098702B55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1910530018:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1910530019:1":{"text":"この街に、<style=\"highlight\">下半身にはむき出しの尾椎しか残っていない</style>、髪の長い男はいるか？","source_cn":"塔拉萨有没有一个长发男性，<style=highlig...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0938EBA038A2C2EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1910530020:1":{"text":"むき出しの尾椎って……？その人、すごい重傷じゃない。だ、大丈夫なの？","source_cn":"只剩尾骨……？听起来那位先生受伤很严重呀，他、他没事吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFCB14D09C307C1C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:26:1910530020":{"text":"むき出しの尾椎って……？その人、すごい重傷じゃない。だ、大丈夫なの？","source_cn":"只剩尾骨……？听起来那位先生受伤很严重呀，他、他没事吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFCB14D09C307C1C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1910530021:1":{"text":"グレイヴボーン？","source_cn":"亡灵？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6E7712C74A58F6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1910530022:1":{"text":"聞いたことあるぞ。死んでも動ける奴らのことだよな。実際に見たことはねえけど。","source_cn":"咱听说过，是死了还能动的人，咱在陆地上都没见过！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA8D4220ACBC1193","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1910530023:1":{"text":"コネットを連れて浮上する途中で見たのだ。奴は遠くから、動かずにじっとタラサを見つめていた。","source_cn":"我带歌尼特上浮的时候瞥见了，他在远处望着塔拉萨，一动不动。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0E641D9DF69D9DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1910530024:1":{"text":"そのあと、奴は深く潜り、ほどなくして光が湧き出た。","source_cn":"他下潜到更深处之后不久，潮光开始涌上来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9AAD458EAAB3AFDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1910530025:1":{"text":"あれはハダルではない。尾びれも顔立ちもタラサの民と同じだ。","source_cn":"那人绝不是深海族裔，他有塔拉萨人的尾鳍和脸庞。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22CFB48271FCDB59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:32:1910530025":{"text":"あれはハダルではない。尾びれも顔立ちもタラサの民と同じだ。","source_cn":"那人绝不是深海族裔，他有塔拉萨人的尾鳍和脸庞。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22CFB48271FCDB59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1910530026:1":{"text":"絶対そいつの仕業だろ！","source_cn":"嘁，肯定是那混蛋搞的鬼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4A2517D989AF30C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1910530027:1":{"text":"ばあばは各一族の家系図に詳しいから、聞いてみよう。その人が本当にタラサ出身なら、何か知ってるはずだよ。","source_cn":"去问问阿嬷吧，她了解每一家的族谱。如果那个人真是塔拉萨...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F484FF06ED74389","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:32:0:1":{"text":"その人物が光と関係している可能性は高いな。","source_cn":"潮光出现，很可能和他有关","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA3C8AE3DC54CAAF6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"その人物が光と関係している可能性は高いな。","female":"その人物が光と関係している可能性は高いわね。","variant_male_record_index":"95816","variant_female_record_index":"95817","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:32:1:2":{"text":"どの一族にも属さないグレイヴボーン……怪しいな。","source_cn":"不属于任何族裔的亡灵，他最可疑！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2619E27BDE662671","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"どの一族にも属さないグレイヴボーン……怪しいな。","female":"どの一族にも属さないグレイヴボーン……怪しいわね。","variant_male_record_index":"95818","variant_female_record_index":"95819","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:26:0:1":{"text":"まさか、グレイヴボーンを見たのか！？","source_cn":"你是说，你见到一个亡灵？！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1C8792A9466D0A0C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"まさか、グレイヴボーンを見たのか！？","female":"まさか、グレイヴボーンを見たの！？","variant_male_record_index":"95814","variant_female_record_index":"95815","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:17:2:3":{"text":"何か思い当たることでもあるのか？","source_cn":"你是不是想到了什么？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x41A83ED9